  "body_html": "<h1>Ex-Ante Equilibrium Predicates</h1>\n<p>Bayesian mechanisms with transfers include integrability assumptions for\nex-ante expected utility and an ex-ante Bayesian Nash equilibrium predicate.</p>\n<p>The direct Bayesian transfer mechanism interface also provides the truthful\nstrategy profile used in revelation-principle statements.</p>",
